WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:34.000
THE NIGHT BEFORE

01:38.240 --> 01:39.920
My death

01:40.440 --> 01:42.320
will clear the path for Cen Pickles,

01:43.360 --> 01:45.680
and the Tiemo King's life

01:46.200 --> 01:48.440
will draw out
the 3,000 Tiemo shadow guards.

01:49.960 --> 01:51.760
This plan is nearing its end.

01:52.440 --> 01:55.800
Fate will soon show its hand.

01:56.880 --> 02:00.120
The realm's future will soon be decided.

02:25.000 --> 02:30.840
TEA HOUSE

02:38.120 --> 02:38.960
Move!

03:08.080 --> 03:10.200
-Surround Hidden Soldier Alley!
-Yes!

03:11.440 --> 03:13.920
The people who moved
into Hidden Soldier Alley

03:14.000 --> 03:15.520
brought life back to it,

03:16.200 --> 03:17.720
but today,

03:19.360 --> 03:20.800
smoke and fire will return.

03:23.360 --> 03:25.800
Will Mr. Xie Huai'an arrive on time?

03:31.080 --> 03:31.960
Ye Zheng,

03:33.760 --> 03:35.200
the Shen-hour plan

03:36.120 --> 03:39.720
cannot afford a single misstep.

03:40.440 --> 03:41.320
Therefore,

03:41.840 --> 03:44.880
you must appear at the exact place
I designated for you on time

03:46.320 --> 03:47.400
and wait for me there.

03:48.760 --> 03:50.720
This is the grandest stratagem
of his life.

03:54.520 --> 03:55.760
He will not be absent.

03:55.840 --> 03:57.520
TEA HOUSE

04:46.480 --> 04:47.680
Run!

04:49.160 --> 04:50.360
Goodbye!

04:56.200 --> 04:57.160
Get him!

05:07.880 --> 05:10.360
I do not know what tomorrow holds.

05:11.880 --> 05:15.120
But today,
let us say our farewell properly.

05:16.040 --> 05:18.280
If you do that, you will die.

05:23.680 --> 05:25.000
Don't worry.

05:25.080 --> 05:26.400
I promise

05:27.960 --> 05:29.400
we will meet again.

05:30.440 --> 05:32.520
Your task is crucial.

05:34.040 --> 05:35.360
I believe

05:37.040 --> 05:41.160
you can do it.

05:43.120 --> 05:44.760
I won't die.

05:45.520 --> 05:47.760
And you must not die either.

06:18.800 --> 06:22.120
Everything today was arranged in advance,

06:22.760 --> 06:24.600
including the pot mender

06:24.680 --> 06:26.760
and the physician named Yi Zhihu.

06:26.840 --> 06:30.280
What are you hiding
that you cannot tell me outright?

06:36.000 --> 06:36.880
Very well.

06:37.720 --> 06:38.880
I will be honest.

06:43.520 --> 06:46.320
Tomorrow, I will meet the King of Tiemo,

06:47.000 --> 06:48.840
staking my life on this plan.

06:50.360 --> 06:52.000
The pot mender

06:52.520 --> 06:54.600
is linked to the units
I've hidden in the city.

06:55.240 --> 06:56.600
Tomorrow, at the Hour of Shen,

06:57.160 --> 07:00.560
our clash with Tiemo
will unfold inside the city.

07:03.320 --> 07:04.200
And

07:05.040 --> 07:07.000
what will happen to you?

07:12.600 --> 07:13.760
When fireworks rise

07:14.640 --> 07:16.720
at the Hour of Shen,

07:17.320 --> 07:20.560
you and Yi Zhihu should come
to the Tiemo King's residence for me.

07:21.280 --> 07:24.640
As for the outcome,
it rests in Heaven's hands.

07:31.960 --> 07:33.000
Remember:

07:33.800 --> 07:37.440
if you act before the hour of Shen,

07:37.960 --> 07:39.480
you will alert them,

07:40.680 --> 07:43.760
and the entire plan will collapse.

07:46.680 --> 07:48.080
You must not die.

07:50.720 --> 07:52.280
One man's life

07:54.240 --> 07:58.040
is nothing beside the fate of Chang'an.

07:59.240 --> 08:00.320
Besides,

08:01.120 --> 08:02.640
Yi Zhihu's medical skills

08:04.120 --> 08:05.680
match your master's.

08:06.280 --> 08:09.240
Perhaps she will keep me alive.

08:32.080 --> 08:33.480
Sir,

08:33.559 --> 08:35.960
the two of them split in two directions.

08:36.480 --> 08:37.760
We lost them both.

08:41.000 --> 08:43.159
Had Genghui been here,
we wouldn't have failed.

08:46.240 --> 08:48.680
But did Xie Huai'an truly risk his life

08:48.760 --> 08:52.640
just to draw Fang Genghui away
and rescue Xiao Wenjing?

08:55.520 --> 08:56.360
Stay back!

08:57.720 --> 08:59.280
Xiao Wenjing,

09:00.640 --> 09:02.040
you are not useless after all.

09:03.240 --> 09:06.400
But don't forget that Xiao Wuyang
is still in our hands.

09:07.160 --> 09:08.880
He's in Yulong Ridge, isn't he?

09:10.160 --> 09:11.960
Someone is already on the way to save him.

09:24.560 --> 09:25.480
Kill Xiao Wuyang!

09:26.080 --> 09:27.440
Break through!

09:27.520 --> 09:28.360
Charge!

09:42.120 --> 09:43.480
Kill Xiao Wuyang!

10:07.400 --> 10:09.120
You won't be able to rescue Xiao Wuyang.

10:09.200 --> 10:10.920
Even if we fail,

10:11.560 --> 10:13.560
the Tiemo King will die
in Hidden Soldier Alley.

10:14.800 --> 10:15.760
At worst,

10:16.960 --> 10:19.000
we trade one life for another.

10:24.760 --> 10:25.720
Sir.

10:32.640 --> 10:34.160
Report!

10:39.240 --> 10:40.120
Sir,

10:40.200 --> 10:41.480
Wuyang troops have entered the city

10:41.560 --> 10:42.520
They've surrounded Hidden Soldier Alley.

10:43.120 --> 10:44.360
Hidden Soldier Alley?

10:46.040 --> 10:47.320
Is His Majesty still at his residence?

12:18.840 --> 12:20.760
GLOWING MIST

12:43.360 --> 12:46.000
TEA HOUSE

12:46.080 --> 12:47.240
Zheng.

12:48.360 --> 12:49.560
Has he returned?

12:50.760 --> 12:51.920
He has.

12:55.200 --> 12:56.960
This is the next move.

13:02.440 --> 13:04.720
THE TIEMO KING WILL BE LOCKED
IN BATTLE WITH YAN FENGSHAN.

13:12.800 --> 13:14.360
We've fallen into Xie Huai'an's trap.

13:14.880 --> 13:17.280
His Majesty has been taken by Cen Pickles.

13:19.760 --> 13:21.480
Surround Hidden Soldier Alley!

14:36.760 --> 14:38.080
DEFEND THE CAPITAL

14:38.160 --> 14:40.840
Breaking into the granary
will not be easy.

14:41.520 --> 14:42.960
They made the first move.

14:43.040 --> 14:45.200
The whole ward must have become a trap.

14:45.280 --> 14:49.520
Xie Huai'an wants
to force a decisive battle.

14:51.280 --> 14:52.880
Hidden Soldier Alley is certainly a trap.

14:53.760 --> 14:55.360
The guards at the Imperial Guard Station

14:55.960 --> 14:58.120
may not be able to break through.

14:59.680 --> 15:02.240
Notify every shadow guard
in the city to don armor

15:02.320 --> 15:04.920
-and converge on Hidden Soldier Alley.
-Understood.

15:14.280 --> 15:15.640
I know your concern.

15:15.720 --> 15:19.000
To expose the shadow guards
is to reveal our last hand.

15:19.680 --> 15:20.880
But Genghui,

15:21.840 --> 15:23.520
His Majesty cannot die.

15:24.240 --> 15:25.480
If he falls,

15:25.560 --> 15:28.240
even if our army takes Chang'an,

15:28.320 --> 15:29.920
trouble will never end.

15:30.440 --> 15:32.920
WINE HOUSE

15:39.600 --> 15:40.680
WAREHOUSE

15:49.120 --> 15:50.840
For years,

15:50.920 --> 15:54.720
our 3,000 shadow guards
have scouted every corner of Chang'an,

15:55.360 --> 15:57.040
including Hidden Soldier Alley.

15:57.880 --> 15:59.720
This spot has long been
piled with clutter,

15:59.800 --> 16:01.120
poorly guarded,

16:01.720 --> 16:03.680
and forgotten.

16:05.360 --> 16:09.000
From here,
we can cut straight into the alley.

16:25.720 --> 16:27.880
WINE HOUSE

16:33.120 --> 16:34.560
Stay close. Move!

16:43.840 --> 16:46.280
The formation inside Hidden Soldier Alley
is already set.

16:46.360 --> 16:49.360
The breach on the west side
was left there on purpose.

16:50.000 --> 16:52.480
It is the death gate
laid for the Tiemo forces.

16:53.240 --> 16:54.240
To save their king,

16:54.840 --> 16:56.480
they will enter through it.

16:57.120 --> 16:58.160
Once they're in,

16:58.760 --> 17:00.520
they will never leave.

20:05.960 --> 20:07.680
Among Tiemo forces,

20:07.760 --> 20:10.680
only centurions and above
carry the command arrows,

20:11.680 --> 20:13.160
and a centurion

20:13.240 --> 20:15.320
is hard to kill.

20:16.040 --> 20:18.120
Ye Zheng, this is your task.

20:19.280 --> 20:20.800
Gather the command arrows.

20:20.880 --> 20:23.120
They will be of great use to us.

21:47.280 --> 21:49.040
The Tiemo King
is not in Hidden Soldier Alley.

21:49.800 --> 21:51.440
The Wuyang Army's blockade

21:52.120 --> 21:54.800
is only a performance
to mislead the Tiemo people.

22:50.360 --> 22:51.720
The command arrow

22:51.800 --> 22:54.320
is their signal for reinforcements.

22:55.480 --> 22:58.240
More shadow guards, armored and armed,

22:59.000 --> 23:00.720
will break in from the west side
of the alley

23:00.800 --> 23:02.200
and walk straight into our trap.

23:03.320 --> 23:04.960
Tiemo will commit all its strength

23:05.640 --> 23:07.120
and have no cards left.

23:08.360 --> 23:10.240
We will put everything to an end

23:10.760 --> 23:12.520
in Hidden Soldier Alley.

23:26.280 --> 23:28.120
Even if you kill me,

23:30.120 --> 23:31.480
you still…

23:46.040 --> 23:46.880
Are there more enemies?

23:47.520 --> 23:48.360
All dead.

24:07.880 --> 24:09.000
What is it?

24:09.600 --> 24:10.800
By now,

24:11.920 --> 24:13.160
inside the granary,

24:14.840 --> 24:16.520
the victor has already been decided.

24:34.120 --> 24:35.800
After all these years,

24:36.800 --> 24:38.480
you are still trapped in that granary.

24:39.560 --> 24:40.800
Today,

24:42.000 --> 24:43.240
you will not walk out either.

25:14.040 --> 25:15.600
I've always wanted to ask you something.

25:16.480 --> 25:18.040
On that snowy night,

25:18.600 --> 25:19.760
why did you spare him?

25:25.920 --> 25:28.840
They say that on Mount Shiluoman

25:30.080 --> 25:32.440
lives a rare toad,

25:33.040 --> 25:34.280
hideously ugly.

25:34.920 --> 25:35.760
‎A toad?

25:37.760 --> 25:39.120
When it meets its own kind,

25:40.240 --> 25:42.000
it is frightened by the other's ugliness

25:43.040 --> 25:45.000
and exudes an oil in shock,

25:46.560 --> 25:48.040
only to realize

25:49.640 --> 25:51.160
it is just as ugly.

25:53.720 --> 25:55.120
The tale exists.

25:55.640 --> 25:58.800
That oil is said to be
the world's only cure for regret.

26:06.680 --> 26:08.680
I spared Yan Fengshan that night

26:12.240 --> 26:13.960
because I thought of that toad.

26:15.920 --> 26:17.080
In his eyes,

26:20.520 --> 26:22.800
I seemed to see myself.

26:26.600 --> 26:28.720
Finish it, White Hair.

26:41.120 --> 26:41.960
No.

26:43.400 --> 26:45.160
You must die slowly.

26:46.720 --> 26:48.160
That hurts more.

26:51.760 --> 26:53.400
A traitor like you

26:54.400 --> 26:56.040
should have died long ago.

26:57.400 --> 26:58.520
Speak.

27:01.040 --> 27:02.400
Why did you rebel?

27:04.280 --> 27:06.360
You never walked out

27:07.200 --> 27:09.240
of the Liu Manor

27:09.320 --> 27:11.520
after the night it fell 15 years ago.

27:12.480 --> 27:17.320
I never walked out of the granary
at Chen Valley, either.

27:18.200 --> 27:19.840
I've always believed

27:20.920 --> 27:23.040
that only by killing everyone

27:23.680 --> 27:25.320
can I stay alive.

27:29.960 --> 27:31.800
Aren't you the same?

27:34.040 --> 27:35.120
Yes.

27:36.720 --> 27:38.320
Only by killing my enemies

27:39.440 --> 27:41.120
can I go on living.

27:42.200 --> 27:43.480
In truth,

27:44.840 --> 27:47.720
you and I share one enemy.

27:48.760 --> 27:51.640
The one who drove me into that granary.

27:52.360 --> 27:55.320
He took part in your father's murder.

27:55.400 --> 27:57.240
On the night your family was massacred,

27:57.960 --> 27:59.920
he stood in the shadows.

28:01.000 --> 28:02.280
You remember him,

28:03.200 --> 28:04.960
but you do not know him.

28:05.480 --> 28:06.840
After I die,

28:07.680 --> 28:09.160
he will come.

28:21.680 --> 28:23.320
The Huben Army's top shadow guard

28:24.360 --> 28:25.800
must have made preparations

28:26.880 --> 28:28.680
for his death.

28:30.080 --> 28:31.880
Somewhere in this house,

28:31.960 --> 28:34.640
there must be a head
wearing a face made to match yours.

29:12.920 --> 29:14.720
Why did you return?

29:16.640 --> 29:18.040
After that night,

29:19.400 --> 29:21.360
I sat on the street for a long time.

29:23.320 --> 29:27.000
The streets of Chang'an
truly are a fine sight.

29:28.440 --> 29:29.960
People came and went,

29:32.000 --> 29:33.480
living their lives as usual.

29:36.120 --> 29:37.880
No one spoke of Yan Fengshan's

29:39.160 --> 29:40.520
rise or fall.

29:45.120 --> 29:46.520
Tomorrow, at the Shen hour,

29:47.680 --> 29:49.560
fight for Chang'an,

29:51.440 --> 29:53.680
and you will finally
walk out of that granary.

29:54.720 --> 29:56.000
Your ending

29:57.440 --> 29:58.960
is yours to choose.

30:07.440 --> 30:11.040
Thank you for granting me this chance.

30:11.640 --> 30:12.880
I am granting nothing.

30:16.960 --> 30:18.320
You killed my family.

30:19.520 --> 30:21.800
The Liu clan will never forgive you.

30:29.760 --> 30:31.480
You carved this amulet

30:33.720 --> 30:35.760
for Liu Li back then.

30:36.800 --> 30:38.640
Now that the realm is in peril,

30:40.400 --> 30:41.880
I use it

30:44.400 --> 30:45.920
to buy your life

30:49.720 --> 30:51.560
and return it to Chang'an.

31:40.560 --> 31:41.960
White Hair,

31:43.640 --> 31:45.400
I owe you nothing now,

31:48.000 --> 31:50.800
and I owe Chang'an nothing.

32:12.040 --> 32:17.120
WINE HOUSE

33:00.120 --> 33:02.040
Even if we cannot save His Majesty,

33:02.920 --> 33:05.040
even if I die here today,

33:06.880 --> 33:10.560
there are still 200,000 Tiemo troops
in your lands.

33:11.640 --> 33:12.640
In half a day's time,

33:13.160 --> 33:15.400
they will reach Chang'an.

33:16.160 --> 33:17.320
When they arrive,

33:17.880 --> 33:20.320
the city will run with blood.

33:25.360 --> 33:26.640
You think

33:27.920 --> 33:29.840
Xie Huai'an did not foresee that?

33:32.800 --> 33:36.800
The Baiwenhu Army fell so easily
because that was Gu Yu's stratagem.

33:38.120 --> 33:39.360
By not fighting to the death,

33:39.440 --> 33:42.000
they preserved most of their forces.

33:42.600 --> 33:45.920
For this,
Xie Huai'an devised his master plan.

33:47.320 --> 33:49.160
As the Tiemo army marched south,

33:49.680 --> 33:51.480
Xie Huai'an's messenger

33:51.560 --> 33:53.760
met with the four regional commanders.

33:54.440 --> 33:58.160
If they refused to help
break the siege of Chang'an,

33:58.240 --> 33:59.920
the Baiwenhu Army

34:00.000 --> 34:03.000
would immediately take Xie Huai'an's order
and attack them.

34:03.600 --> 34:05.240
The choice between perishing together

34:05.320 --> 34:07.840
and standing united against Tiemo

34:07.920 --> 34:09.600
should be

34:11.400 --> 34:12.719
easy to make, shouldn't it?

34:19.880 --> 34:21.199
By now,

34:21.280 --> 34:25.400
your Tiemo army should already
be under attack from all sides.

34:27.880 --> 34:29.000
Impossible.

34:29.679 --> 34:31.199
How so?

34:32.760 --> 34:33.760
I see.

34:34.360 --> 34:36.920
The military reports you received
did not say any of this,

34:37.760 --> 34:38.800
did they?

34:43.719 --> 34:45.679
Xie Huai'an and the Huben Army
have reconciled.

34:46.520 --> 34:50.800
That force, skilled in disguise
and infiltration, was his by right.

34:51.400 --> 34:53.719
They merely did what they excelled at

34:53.800 --> 34:56.520
and slipped
into your intelligence network.

34:57.520 --> 35:00.280
So for the past three days,
every report you received

35:01.480 --> 35:03.280
was exactly what we wanted you to see.

35:09.080 --> 35:10.000
By the way,

35:10.760 --> 35:12.680
the battle in Hidden Soldier Alley
was also a ruse,

35:12.760 --> 35:15.360
meant to draw out
every shadow guard you had

35:15.440 --> 35:16.800
in the city.

35:17.560 --> 35:18.560
And one more thing.

35:18.640 --> 35:19.840
The Tiemo King

35:21.480 --> 35:22.920
was never here.

35:26.760 --> 35:27.880
By now,

35:28.680 --> 35:31.360
he should already be dead somewhere else.

35:44.320 --> 35:45.280
Accept defeat.

36:00.640 --> 36:02.440
You wanted an alliance with me,
didn't you?

36:03.160 --> 36:06.280
Then sign this treaty

36:07.760 --> 36:08.800
and withdraw your troops.

36:10.240 --> 36:11.320
Otherwise,

36:11.880 --> 36:13.880
two generations of Tiemo's strength,

36:14.600 --> 36:17.560
every man fit to ride into battle,

36:18.080 --> 36:19.320
will die.

36:20.960 --> 36:23.000
None will be able to return home.

36:49.520 --> 36:50.720
THE EMPEROR PAYS RESPECTS
TO THE KING OF TIEMO.

36:50.800 --> 36:52.320
ENVOY WUYIN CHONG PROPOSES
A CEASEFIRE AND RESTORATION.

36:52.400 --> 36:53.920
A NEW PACT IS FORGED TO BRING PEACE.

37:35.040 --> 37:39.600
GRAIN STORE, NO OPEN FLAMES

39:20.480 --> 39:21.520
White Hair?

39:34.000 --> 39:36.080
Yan Fengshan died for you.

39:37.200 --> 39:39.400
And Cen Pickles risked everything for you.

39:41.080 --> 39:43.280
You truly are something.

39:59.760 --> 40:01.840
They did not risk their lives for me.

40:06.320 --> 40:09.840
They only wished to protect
the grain and flour of Chang'an.

40:29.840 --> 40:31.600
You asked me what I lived for.

40:36.960 --> 40:38.000
I live

40:40.000 --> 40:42.640
for that same grain and flour.

40:50.920 --> 40:53.880
Since it's over the grain and flour,

40:54.880 --> 40:56.640
you and I are enemies.

40:56.720 --> 40:58.800
If you die here,

40:59.680 --> 41:01.360
no one will know.

41:01.440 --> 41:03.360
I spent years planning

41:04.640 --> 41:06.080
before returning to Chang'an

41:08.680 --> 41:11.200
to destroy the entire Huben Army,

41:16.880 --> 41:18.040
yet I failed to realize

41:20.280 --> 41:21.960
I was one of them.

41:24.800 --> 41:25.640
My father

41:27.160 --> 41:29.840
raised the Huben Army for Chang'an.

41:30.440 --> 41:31.760
Every member is a shadow guard.

41:33.120 --> 41:36.680
So many died
without leaving their names behind.

41:39.120 --> 41:41.240
That is the price of protection.

41:44.160 --> 41:47.640
For a Huben guard, killing the enemy

41:48.160 --> 41:50.200
is the highest merit.

41:50.280 --> 41:51.920
You think

41:52.880 --> 41:54.320
you can win?

41:59.520 --> 42:02.200
The shadow guards you hid in the city

42:02.880 --> 42:06.080
all believe you are trapped
in the granary of Hidden Soldier Alley.

42:07.560 --> 42:09.320
The remnants of the Baiwenhu Army

42:10.960 --> 42:13.120
and the forces
of the four regional commanders

42:13.760 --> 42:16.040
have already united.

42:17.440 --> 42:19.520
The entire heartland of the empire

42:20.720 --> 42:23.280
has become a trap for your Tiemo army.

42:25.000 --> 42:26.400
Do you think

42:27.160 --> 42:28.680
you can win?

42:29.200 --> 42:31.280
As long as I live,

42:33.040 --> 42:34.880
the victor is not yet decided.

42:42.320 --> 42:43.480
White Hair,

42:45.480 --> 42:46.320
you

42:49.160 --> 42:51.840
dragged yourself here on sheer will alone.

42:53.360 --> 42:55.000
How do you plan to kill me?

42:58.400 --> 43:01.040
Can hands meant
for writing and pouring tea

43:01.680 --> 43:03.600
even lift a sword?

43:06.960 --> 43:08.400
Can the words

43:09.320 --> 43:10.960
protect Chang'an kill me?

43:13.120 --> 43:13.960
No.

43:15.040 --> 43:16.920
But another phrase can.

43:20.880 --> 43:23.640
Fifteen years ago, at the Grand Academy,

43:24.960 --> 43:27.560
when you taught us to make funnel timers,

43:28.560 --> 43:29.800
you said six words.

43:42.040 --> 43:45.280
SERVICE AND DUTY,
HONEST EFFORT, INNER DISCIPLINE

43:49.600 --> 43:51.240
REVERE THE MASTER, UPHOLD THE WAY

44:18.200 --> 44:21.560
CONTEMPLATION

44:23.640 --> 44:25.720
The room is full of flour dust.

44:26.320 --> 44:28.240
Settle the dust, to prevent fire.

44:29.120 --> 44:29.960
Remember?

44:30.040 --> 44:31.960
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

44:41.240 --> 44:42.920
With a broken body,

44:43.960 --> 44:45.880
I will kill the King of Tiemo.

44:46.520 --> 44:47.680
Today,

44:47.760 --> 44:48.960
I win!

45:19.880 --> 45:24.240
DICHEN TEAHOUSE, TEA

45:30.960 --> 45:32.440
After tomorrow,

45:33.400 --> 45:35.000
I hope Chang'an

45:36.200 --> 45:37.640
can still know such peace.

45:39.680 --> 45:42.600
But you will be gone then.

45:48.360 --> 45:49.840
The plan is set.

45:51.040 --> 45:52.560
Whether I am here or not

45:54.040 --> 45:55.480
won't matter.

46:00.720 --> 46:02.120
This is

46:03.520 --> 46:04.960
the life I chose.

46:07.440 --> 46:12.240
Heaven casts a mournful frost

46:13.000 --> 46:16.920
People drift like wind-tossed weed

46:18.560 --> 46:22.800
Bones return to the plain

46:24.000 --> 46:28.840
As the plain withers and blooms each year

46:40.360 --> 46:44.840
TEA HOUSE

47:11.400 --> 47:12.240
Where is he?

47:17.920 --> 47:18.960
Where is Huai'an?

48:45.200 --> 48:47.160
XIE HUAI'AN

48:48.960 --> 48:51.560
LIU ZHI

48:53.520 --> 48:54.760
THROUGH LIFE’S STORMS,

48:54.840 --> 48:56.000
COURAGE CARRIES US TO BLOOM.

48:56.080 --> 48:57.320
THANK YOU FOR WATCHING.
